{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "82c3da131625a06491d818c29540fec878dc52e089e62ff0695fbb5f8a1f04ff", "ja": "願い", "zh": "愿望", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "68731d47bebd7b20e260918becee59be0f632ff1ad68dd8b9186c0a4fe843396", "ja": "病院で織姫と対面した真珠星。織姫はこれま\nでの事について自分なりに理由を説明する。\nどうして姿を現したのか尋ねる真珠星に織姫\nは「最期にやらなきゃいけないことがある」\n「真珠星。私と、勝負だよ」と告げる。", "zh": "在医院与织姬面对面的真珠星。织姬将自己对至今发生的一切的理由作出解释。\n面对询问她为何现身的真珠星，织姬说道：\n“我还有最后必须完成的事。”\n“真珠星，来和我一决胜负吧。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "93a33abc3427227564ab833016250218eafa728df143a91f777d5c6c6193fa9c", "ja": "（私はマスコミの目をかい潜り、病院を訪ねた。\nもちろん、織姫お姉ちゃんと話をするためだ）", "zh": "（我避开媒体的视线，来到了医院。\n当然是为了和织姬姐姐谈一谈）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "c2ef5b54d9247ab497be2d65e02fd057d5a4bbed6ca23791e5249a714f8b7075", "ja": "……？\n！　真珠星……。", "zh": "……？\n！　真珠星……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "8d9a4394e90f62a67501d43a513991f0656e4e17f2a9a6118cfc8b892d6c6b0e", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……。", "zh": "姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "44b552e39d5e7b62388374f12bf5378c2dcdd5885c0fb4f897b32b7d9c47e131", "ja": "手紙、読んだんでしょ？　全部知ってても、\nお姉ちゃんって呼んでくれるんだ？", "zh": "你已经读过那封信了吧？即使知道了全部真相，\n你还是愿意叫我姐姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "5e55040da7a9a9af5e3fc4ea4f84f80cbda2d2189f5ed14011b96e6cb8424f5a", "ja": "……今さら、他の呼び方なんて思いつかないし。\nそれに、お姉ちゃんはお姉ちゃんでしょ。", "zh": "……事到如今，我也想不出其他称呼了。\n而且，姐姐就是姐姐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "db4a2cf63aa58e3f47b7964a5a3da16303096fe65d96accd307a5e053a59a93d", "ja": "真珠星……。\nあのー……ごめんね？", "zh": "珍珠星……。\n那个……对不起哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "2eb67be6ce5b7341397384f87eca3da8e0d45ab13ef0024305c1d68272bba99a", "ja": "ごめんね？　じゃないでしょ！\nこんな大変な事して……謝って済むわけないし。", "zh": "不是一句“对不起”就算了吧！\n做了这么严重的事……光道歉可解决不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3bd29f5173102b025961dc29809eb958dabe76fc6de30bd07a8bf05a3a3db4e", "ja": "あはは……そうだよね。でも、交通事故は\nわざとじゃないから！　本当の本当に、偶然！", "zh": "啊哈哈……也是呢。可是，交通事故\n真的不是故意的啦！真的是千真万确的偶然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "3b330bd78307964ad0093f02b9c159839579e542cf6ba959312bcdb9ea237282", "ja": "……それを利用しようって\n思いついたのは、私だけどね。", "zh": "……想到要利用这一点的人，确实是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "5a4dd18e1c021e85eefc6397ba73e7331f2bffda33531e6a2f1fbc25272c39d9", "ja": "お葬式して、みんなの記憶からちゃんと消えようって。\n……思ってた以上に、大事になっちゃったけど。", "zh": "办场葬礼，好好地从大家的记忆中消失……  \n……没想到事情会闹得这么大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "0041f9a319188036a56ef248ba3d2fc98a1c72ece168236bb385057063e3bb3f", "ja": "当たり前でしょ……。\nあの、お父さんとお母さんは、このこと……。", "zh": "这不是理所当然的嘛……\n那个，叔叔和阿姨……也知道这件事吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "c46a7f8659eda1324826c9a3327f0c0276e42b683311bd25b47e338ac888fd5e", "ja": "知ってるよ。\nすごい無理言って、私から頼んだから。", "zh": "他们知道的。\n是我厚着脸皮，亲自去拜托他们的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "6552b1cf6ee65d69d7953036ca6b646120fe21dd5c0fb10fcf92e4b489ebe72e", "ja": "……知らなかったの、私だけじゃん……。\n……。", "zh": "……原来不知道的，就只有我一个啊……\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "212d0e857bfca677389529c87d0c0ed78e34f0de2dad338551ef9de539ffbf96", "ja": "ねえ、私は……？", "zh": "喂，那我呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "460964e08f94db4f9bd8ac911523c4745af59815f7f89a3237f49e47902a1079", "ja": "……どうして、私に話してくれなかったの？\n私に、会いたくなかった……？", "zh": "……为什么，不肯跟我说呢？\n是……不想见我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "f73cf78d4c16e1cc810c0cb759c6af1153ec846a46aa0839ed9efb34b61576a9", "ja": "ううん、会いたかったよ。\n一番、真珠星に会いたかった。", "zh": "不，我想见你的。\n我最想见到真珠星了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "12ba9ad5d7fd029a31d1929cdabc130c5f44302a1a8a35164f31214e8a32b6a6", "ja": "一目見られたら、もうそれで満足しちゃうくらい。\nほら、私死んじゃうからさ。", "zh": "哪怕只看一眼，我就已经满足了。你看，因为我会死掉嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "62270e01ba178b4838731d6daf4d6d8a275ab9e6ca06fe94720da2ec6fda9a58", "ja": "そんなこと言わないで……。", "zh": "别说这种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "b8c3a743961ab21bb417a152cf374b45dda7143e5a44d4d4a57f1894130090d7", "ja": "でも、本当のことだよ。\n……だから、会えなかった。", "zh": "可是，这是事实啊。  \n……所以，才没能见面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "a65f5b62f04598c9c865281aef946bd377fabffb72448c51f1f49984c1817a26", "ja": "私が弱っていくところなんて、\n真珠星には見せられないって思ったから……。", "zh": "因为我觉得，自己变得越来越虚弱的样子，\n是不能让珍珠星看到的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "8d9a4394e90f62a67501d43a513991f0656e4e17f2a9a6118cfc8b892d6c6b0e", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……。", "zh": "姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac459afec4a6b1b11be113c82353151b3ee87a3b11f72b27b21062fdb7f0c3d5", "ja": "死んじゃう前に、私が今いる場所、大好きな人たち。\n全部、真珠星にあげたいなって思ったの。", "zh": "我想着，在死去之前，要把我现在所在的地方，还有最喜欢的人们，全部送给真珠星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "95a2ac8405ea9ec0d04bb7534dba6bd16dd8e0c7c7d898a5116add0db5fcc610", "ja": "それで、元気な私だけ覚えててほしかった。\n……えへへ、なんてね。", "zh": "所以，我只希望大家记住精神饱满的我。  \n……嘿嘿，开玩笑的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "54304db7ec6ca6fb66c0da6cd0907d06eecbef5d74b78d0c8e69870cc9278b7b", "ja": "……なら、どうしてSNSでメッセージを……？\nわざとマスコミに見つかるように、姿も見せて……。", "zh": "……那，为什么还要在社交媒体上留言呢……？\n甚至还故意现身，让媒体发现……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "935391b044e371b3988a70d7985e689be1f904adc9932832dfe36e5550a38309", "ja": "うん……それはね。死んじゃう前に、最期に、\nやらなきゃいけない事があるって気が付いたの。", "zh": "嗯……是因为，我发现自己在死之前，临终前，还有一件必须要做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "f15669b962a35781f72db632ec72f2be9bb018632b5f976d44f33d4e141390b1", "ja": "やらなきゃいけないこと……？", "zh": "必须要做的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "bc5800aaea69c7d2f33d156255c43146a00185b04a8739a570811621a42df9ff", "ja": "真珠星。\n私と、勝負だよ。", "zh": "珍珠星。\n来和我一决胜负吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "59625fada3ddff1e2a830b29312319248c312f0ef87c78949d854cd3c5e94c46", "ja": "（お姉ちゃんに会った後、\n久しぶりに両親とも話すことができた）", "zh": "（见到姐姐之后，我也终于久违地和父母说上了话）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "04e1a0174b81aa163644e0dab601b73ef48c7f59e44a804d31a05974df7d5290", "ja": "お父さん、お母さん……。\nどうして神宮寺さんのこと、私に黙ってたの？", "zh": "爸爸、妈妈……\n为什么要瞒着我关于神宫寺小姐的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "953b4f07a55dc2df25d3cf9a46d42db9aab25628e428953a93a189c307b086f5", "ja": "私はお父さんやお母さんを恨んだり、\n嫌いになんてなったりしないのに。", "zh": "我明明不会怨恨爸爸妈妈，也不会讨厌他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "11fc891dab042acc2dce0e071735e3d3c23487d4f820e3e7401400a6ea785e80", "ja": "それより、ちゃんと育ててくれたことに、\n感謝してるくらいだし……。", "zh": "比起那些，我更感谢他们把我好好养大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1033_itimiyatiti", "source_sha256": "83e1916e0d4a702296041d5b9e674eb6b6f1d25d659ddd276b4279c7a0241d91", "ja": "真珠星はいい子だからね。正直に言えばだけど……\n僕達はどう思われてもよかったんだよ。", "zh": "真珠星是个好孩子嘛。虽然说实话……别人怎么看我们都无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1034_itimiyatiti", "source_sha256": "66990e3f00ac2d84242a0b42bcf037fa546dee1e94ef35639617ec67b8c295ff", "ja": "でも、神宮寺さん……七星さんは違う。\n……真珠星は、絶対に彼女を恨まないって言える？", "zh": "可是，神宫寺小姐……七星小姐不一样。\n……你能说真珠星绝对不会怨恨她吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1036_itimiyatiti", "source_sha256": "367a112a1a07bb0eb4e7ee4003bfd921c415fe03d2ab460a56f2d96d930fc98b", "ja": "彼女のことを恨んでほしくなくて。\n真珠星はほら、怒ると話を聞いてくれないから。", "zh": "我不想让你恨她。\n因为真珠星一旦生气，可就不会听别人说话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "aeb58aee5d1409b5c8afe07d7ca588b8d0e1869cd9e8a0cc360dffce34d1369e", "ja": "ぐ、ぐぬぬ……！　……はあ。やっぱり\n私のこと、よくわかってるなぁ……。", "zh": "唔、唔唔唔……！……唉，果然很了解我啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0369_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_05_1038_itimiyasiratori", "source_sha256": "76d207b573ee9a834218c1bd21b5f64e05ef97f1cf98e4545d43567477f5d4a7", "ja": "真珠星、本当にごめんなさい。\n苦労ばかりかけてしまって……。", "zh": "真珠星，真的很对不起。  \n一直让你操心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
